                                        "glosses": [
                                            "covered with leaves"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b223906-c8f5-4f20-9163-6684d67e7565",
                                                "sense_id": "5fea6820-7c94-30a8-b0a5-3bdca2a906b9",
                                                "text": "leafy trees"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ce0182e-50fb-345a-8945-88a23f505469",
                                        "entry_id": "97561c97-e863-390b-b686-5bd1089133ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "containing much foliage"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63f2fb11-3e0a-40d8-861b-f30d30464cd6",
                                                "sense_id": "2ce0182e-50fb-345a-8945-88a23f505469",
                                                "text": "a leafy avenue"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94df020e-1bb0-4f2b-b7e2-3568309aace4",
                                                "sense_id": "2ce0182e-50fb-345a-8945-88a23f505469",
                                                "text": "The Earth is facing a climate crisis, but it’s also getting greener and leafier. According to new research, the rise is largely courtesy of China and India."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7f5ec836-dcc0-3069-b689-a85e4bc4a696",
                                        "entry_id": "97561c97-e863-390b-b686-5bd1089133ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "in the form of leaves (of some material)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61f5d427-a301-3d65-941a-bf492b7f3f88",
                                        "entry_id": "97561c97-e863-390b-b686-5bd1089133ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "resembling a leaf"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac5762c4-2729-40f0-9ec7-ae619d8d9d0f",
                                                "sense_id": "61f5d427-a301-3d65-941a-bf492b7f3f88",
                                                "text": "Another option is to wash spinach and other leafy greens thoroughly in running water before eating them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1b0cb4a-7a0c-3eae-be45-46c7f37580e2",
                                        "entry_id": "97561c97-e863-390b-b686-5bd1089133ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "wealthy, middle- or upper-class"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a place"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92559a15-5170-4e9e-8626-d5b5e8d6ed5b",
                                                "sense_id": "c1b0cb4a-7a0c-3eae-be45-46c7f37580e2",
                                                "text": "They live in a beautiful house in a leafy suburb."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2011eb2-6829-4e04-9ca9-d85628d80c83",
                                                "sense_id": "c1b0cb4a-7a0c-3eae-be45-46c7f37580e2",
                                                "text": "Those are not necessarily the leafiest areas. From the tenants of Durham, £1,671,546 was used to subsidise people elsewhere. I am not familiar with Durham, it may be a very leafy place in the north-east, but I suspect that there is a need for those funds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1ed1bf3-ff0b-42ef-b20e-5bb4f9276617",
                                                "sense_id": "c1b0cb4a-7a0c-3eae-be45-46c7f37580e2",
                                                "text": "Income tax payments cost the average British taxpayer £4,985 a year, but those who reside in the leafiest areas of the country pay three times this amount."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44ac920d-5462-4985-9d69-809d5767483f",
                                                "sense_id": "c1b0cb4a-7a0c-3eae-be45-46c7f37580e2",
                                                "text": "The Tories plan to give their all against the other Ukip defector, Mark Reckless, in the more prosperous Rochester & Strood next month. But this plays to the stereotype: Tories fighting for leafy areas, hiding from the poorer ones."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce7d6f83-0893-48a3-93f1-058c292cfa59",
                                                "sense_id": "c1b0cb4a-7a0c-3eae-be45-46c7f37580e2",
                                                "text": "In an essay for the New Yorker about her own move, also prompted by a breakup, Dunham contrasts the chaotic grit of New York with the “spaciousness” of London – a city that “doesn’t jangle me”. Dunham, as you may by now be sensing, lives in one of the leafier parts of north London."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
